│ The patch adds a do_not_call_in_templates attribute to the Choices │
│ class to prevent it from being callable in Django templates. This  │
│ attribute is added to the class definition in the                  │
│ custom_package/choices.py file, which is the likely location of    │
│ the enum definitions. The patch ensures that the class is treated  │
│ as a static value rather than a callable function in template      │
│ contexts.                                                          │
